        <!-- Overview -->
        <div class="project-section">
            <h2>Overview</h2>

            <p>
                Asemble a board which helps transmit singal from the ground station switches to actuate the solenoid and release the fluid valves. 
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Project Workflow -->
        <div class="project-section">
            <h2>Project Workflow</h2>

            <p>
                Replace the old ardunio uno into esp32 microcontrol. Access power transmittion. The board contains a ethernet cable, connected to the ground stations, esp32 microcontroller to read signals, buck converter to step down voltage from the 24V battery LIPO, level Shifter to step up to 5V signal required by the solenoid, MOSTFET to communicate to solenoid, and connectors wired to the solenoid. 
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>
                    CAD and Lasercut the board
                </li>
                <li>
                    Strip wires and assemble the board
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>



